ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡He encontrado lo que buscaba!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Pero ya contaba con ello...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡En los grandes almacenes
siempre tienen de todo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It always seems like they turn up
the heat in department stores.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0022:}}I broke out in a serious sweat!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Nei grandi magazzini tengono
il riscaldamento sempre al massimo.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0022:}}Sembra quasi di stare in una sauna!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Büyük Mağaza'da ısıtıcıyı hep
fazla açıyorlar sanki.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0022:}}Resmen ter içinde kaldım!
